---
import DetailLayout from "../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---
<DetailLayout seoTitle="Contact the Guilin & Yangshuo Travel Guide Team" title="Contact" subtitle="Questions, corrections, or partnership enquiries — here's how to reach us." description="Contact the Guilin & Yangshuo Travel Guide team: report outdated prices or closed attractions, or ask a travel question. A human replies within a week.">
  <h2>How to Reach Us</h2>
  <p>Everything on this site is written and maintained by a small independent team. The fastest way to reach us is email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. No phone hotline, no ticket portal, no chatbot — a human reads every message.</p>

  <h2>What We Respond To Best</h2>
  <h3>Corrections &amp; On-the-Ground Reports</h3>
  <p>Price changed, attraction closed, ferry schedule shifted, hotel gone downhill? Tell us which page and what you saw. Verified reports are fixed within a week and the page date updates.</p>
  <h3>Travel Questions</h3>
  <p>We get a lot of "should I do 2 days or 3?" questions. Check the <a href="/guilin-yangshuo-itinerary-3-day/">3-day itinerary</a> and <a href="/guilin-travel-mistakes/">mistakes guide</a> first — chances are it's already answered.</p>
  <h3>Partnerships</h3>
  <p>We don't accept sponsored posts, paid placements, free trips, or affiliate deals. If your pitch depends on any of those, we're not the right site.</p>

  <h2>Response Times</h2>
  <p>We aim to reply to everything within 7 days. Corrections that flag wrong prices or safety-relevant changes jump the queue. We can't offer bespoke itinerary planning over email — that's what the <a href="/china-trip-builder/">trip builder</a> and <a href="/guilin-trip-cost-calculator/">cost calculator</a> are for.</p>
</DetailLayout>
